    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a pure and distraction-free chess experience with Just Chess!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, this game offers a clean and accessible way to play chess against a computer opponent in a modern 3D setting \u2014 now with full chess clock support and multiple time control options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Chessboard</strong> \u2013 With an adjustable viewing angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip &amp; Reset View</strong> \u2013 Use F to flip the board and R to reset it to your playing side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Clocks &amp; Time Controls</strong> \u2013 Play timed games with popular formats like Bullet (1+0), Blitz (5+3), Rapid (10+5), and Classical (30+0, 90/40). Untimed mode is also available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Chess Clocks</strong> \u2013 Switch between practical 2D and immersive 3D clock views using the C key. 3D clocks show remaining time as a circular diagram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Move Speed</strong> \u2013 Customize how fast the chess engine plays its moves for a more relaxed or time-pressured experience. Combine with difficulty settings for a personalized challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and an intuitive interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI Strength</strong> \u2013 The AI automatically adjusts its strength based on your wins and losses, ensuring a balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Chess Engine</strong> \u2013 Play offline instantly using the game's internal chess engine, no setup required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UCI Engine Support</strong> \u2013 You can connect an external chess engine that supports the UCI protocol, such as Stockfish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PGN Export and Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game allows you to copy the chess game in PGN format to the clipboard and analyze it on online chess analysis websites. Online analysis may require an account with the analysis service provider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> \u2013 Unlock achievements as you play and test your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: External chess engines must be downloaded separately. Please use only trusted sources. The developer is not responsible for third-party software.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a pure and distraction-free chess experience with Just Chess!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, this game offers a clean and accessible way to play chess against a computer opponent in a modern 3D setting \u2014 now with full chess clock support and multiple time control options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Chessboard</strong> \u2013 With an adjustable viewing angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip &amp; Reset View</strong> \u2013 Use F to flip the board and R to reset it to your playing side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Clocks &amp; Time Controls</strong> \u2013 Play timed games with popular formats like Bullet (1+0), Blitz (5+3), Rapid (10+5), and Classical (30+0, 90/40). Untimed mode is also available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Chess Clocks</strong> \u2013 Switch between practical 2D and immersive 3D clock views using the C key. 3D clocks show remaining time as a circular diagram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Move Speed</strong> \u2013 Customize how fast the chess engine plays its moves for a more relaxed or time-pressured experience. Combine with difficulty settings for a personalized challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and an intuitive interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI Strength</strong> \u2013 The AI automatically adjusts its strength based on your wins and losses, ensuring a balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Chess Engine</strong> \u2013 Play offline instantly using the game's internal chess engine, no setup required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UCI Engine Support</strong> \u2013 You can connect an external chess engine that supports the UCI protocol, such as Stockfish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PGN Export and Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game allows you to copy the chess game in PGN format to the clipboard and analyze it on online chess analysis websites. Online analysis may require an account with the analysis service provider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> \u2013 Unlock achievements as you play and test your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: External chess engines must be downloaded separately. Please use only trusted sources. The developer is not responsible for third-party software.</i></p>",
